5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Since this is the first day, we have no information yet. Let's use this time to observe everyone's behavior. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they would like to share?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful idea, Minako dear. Let us all be patient and kind to one another as we figure this out. I am looking forward to our conversation.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Minako. Since we have no clues yet, we should focus on how everyone reacts to the pressure. Let's keep the conversation open and see who tries to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A very sensible approach, Mizuki. I shall happily play the role of the observer for now. Let us see whose mask slips first while we maintain this delightful civility, shall we?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to play! I agree with everyone. Let's just talk and get to know each other better. I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"It seems we are all in agreement for now. Since we are observing, I'm curious if anyone has a specific method for identifying the werewolf or the possessed. @Kenji, you seem eager; do you have a plan?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see such enthusiasm in Kenji. I believe that by listening to the warmth and sincerity in each other's voices, the truth will naturally reveal itself to us in time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Sincerity is a start, Shizue, but logic is more reliable. I'll be looking for contradictions in statements and those who are overly eager to deflect suspicion. Let's see if anyone's ""warmth"" feels forced.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic is indeed a sturdy shield, Mizuki. However, the most cunning wolves often dress their lies in the finest logic. I shall be watching for the gaps between what is said and what is intended.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, I don't have a super fancy plan, but I'll just be honest and friendly! I think if we all trust each other, we can figure it out together. I'm just happy to be here!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Honesty is a good starting point, Kenji, but we must remember that the werewolf and the possessed will also try to appear honest. Let's remain vigilant while we maintain this cooperation.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Minako is quite right to remind us. It is a delicate balance, isn't it? We must keep our hearts open while remaining mindful. I trust that we can all find a way through this together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. Trust is a luxury we can't fully afford yet. I'll be paying close attention to who agrees with whom too quickly. Sometimes, the Possessed tries too hard to blend in by mirroring others.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A keen observation, Mizuki. The art of mirroring is a classic deception. I wonder if we shall see any such echoes in our discourse, or perhaps someone attempting to lead the choir too enthusiastically.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, mirroring? That sounds like a cool detective trick! I'll try to be myself and not just copy people. I really want us all to get along, though!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Since we have established our general approach, let's conclude today's discussion. We will have more concrete information tomorrow once the Seer has had their first divination. Until then, let's stay observant.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,It has been a lovely first day of getting to know you all. I shall wish everyone a peaceful night's sleep. Please take care of yourselves.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be watching closely tomorrow. Let's see if the Seer's information brings the truth to light or if the wolf tries to muddy the waters. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A peaceful night indeed, Shizue. I shall retire now to seek a glimpse of the truth. I look forward to seeing how our theories hold up against the reality of tomorrow. Goodnight, all.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams and that the Seer finds something helpful tonight. I'll see you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
