36,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning, everyone. The first night has passed. Since the Seer now has their first piece of information, I would like to hear if anyone is willing to share their findings or if they have noticed anything suspicious.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. I wonder if our kind Seer has found any clues to help us? Please, take your time and share only what you feel is right.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"If the Seer is among us and feels it's safe, now is the time to speak. However, revealing yourself too early can be risky. @Seer, do you have information that can guide us without compromising your safety?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a delicate dance, is it not? To speak is to invite the wolf's appetite, yet to remain silent is to let the shadows grow. I shall be cautious, but I can confirm that Kenji is human.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, wow, thank you for saying that! That makes me feel much better. I'm really glad you trust me! Does that mean you're the Seer, or did you just have a good feeling about me?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, you've claimed Kenji is human. If you are the Seer, this is a strong start. However, if you are not, this could be a tactic to gain trust. Are you officially claiming the Seer role?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is quite a bold and helpful thing to do, Benjamin. I hope your words are true, for the sake of our little group. @Benjamin, could you tell us more about your decision to share this now?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, claiming someone is human is a strategic move. If you are the Seer, you've protected Kenji. If you aren't, you're building a fake alliance. Why choose Kenji specifically for your first reveal?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, a fair question. Kenji's openness is a refreshing contrast to the calculated nature of this game. By confirming his humanity, I provide the village with a reliable anchor while testing how the others react to a known truth.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, you're so nice! I'm honored to be your ""anchor."" I'll do my best to be helpful and honest for everyone! Does anyone else have any clues, or are we just trusting Benjamin for now?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, your reasoning is consistent, but we must remain objective. If you are the Seer, we have one confirmed human. However, we must consider the possibility that you are the Werewolf or Possessed attempting to secure an ally in Kenji.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Minako, you are always so thoughtful to consider every angle. It is a bit frightening to think we might be deceived, but perhaps we can trust Benjamin's kindness for now? It would be such a shame to doubt a helping hand.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, kindness is a virtue, but blind trust is a liability in this game. @Benjamin, your logic is polished, but that's exactly what I'm wary of. If you're lying, you've just bought Kenji's loyalty.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, your skepticism is a necessary ingredient for our survival. I welcome it. If I were the wolf, would I not have chosen a more strategic target to ""clear"" than our most transparent member? I invite you to keep questioning me.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! But I think Benjamin is just being a good friend. I don't feel like he's trying to trick me. Let's try to be positive! Who do you think is the most suspicious person so far?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We must decide on a vote. While Benjamin's claim is helpful, we cannot ignore the risk. However, without a counter-claim from another Seer, we have little evidence to execute anyone. I suggest we proceed with caution. Does anyone have a target?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult choice, isn't it? I feel quite sad that we must choose someone. Since we have no clear evidence, perhaps we should be very careful not to hurt an innocent soul today. What do you all think?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minako, caution is wise, but inaction is also a risk. If Benjamin is lying, he's already manipulating Kenji. Since there's no counter-claim, I'm hesitant to vote, but I'll be watching Benjamin's next move very closely.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we lack a clear culprit, I suggest we avoid a rash execution. Let us trust the process for one more night. I shall use my vision to further illuminate the shadows. I am content to be your target of suspicion, Mizuki.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to vote for anyone if we aren't sure! Benjamin has been so helpful, and I think we should trust him. Let's just be careful and see what happens tomorrow! I'm voting for myself if I have to!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
